lor pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Jumungo.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/5b/Jumungo..png/revision/latest?cb=20240409004112\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Jumungo.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/5b/Jumungo..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240409004112\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/5b/Jumungo..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240409004112 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/5b/Jumungo..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240409004112 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Jumungo.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Jumungo..png\" data-image-name=\"Jumungo..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">17</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\">Steve Pemberton</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grappling_with_my_life.\" title=\"Grappling with my life.\">Grappling with my life.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Some_impropriety%3F\" title=\"Some impropriety?\">Some impropriety?</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Jumungo.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">Series 17</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 4 April 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\">Steve Pemberton</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Jumungo.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Misremembering the name of the movie <i>Jumanji</i>, <a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\">Joanne McNally</a> guessed that \"Jumungo\" was the title of one of the films during the <a href=\"/wiki/Guess_the_movie_that_your_teammate_is_saying\" title=\"Guess the movie that your teammate is saying\">Guess the movie that your teammate is saying</a> task. The title card shows <a href=\"/wiki/Patatas_the_cat\" title=\"Patatas the cat\">Patatas the cat</a> stuck to the ceiling of the house upside down, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Most_fun_thing_to_turn_upside_down\" title=\"Most fun thing to turn upside down\">Most fun thing to turn upside down</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_cat_(Series_17)\" title=\"Rescue the cat (Series 17)\">Rescue the cat</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Stick_the_heaviest_thing_to_the_board_using_three_of_the_ingredients_on_the_shelves\" title=\"Stick the heaviest thing to the board using three of the ingredients on the shelves\">Stick the heaviest thing to the board using three of the ingredients on the shelves</a> tasks.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Titles\">Alternate Titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate Titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Jumungo.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate Titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jumanjee'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Jumungo.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joanne McNally</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Robins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nick_Mohammed\" title=\"Nick Mohammed\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nick Mohammed</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Willan\" title=\"Sophie Willan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sophie Willan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Steve Pemberton</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_fun_thing_to_turn_upside_down\" title=\"Most fun thing to turn upside down\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most fun thing to turn upside down.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_cat_(Series_17)\" title=\"Rescue the cat (Series 17)\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Rescue the cat. The cat must come out of the top hole. Your head may not enter the dome. The door must remain closed.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_epic_thing_using_green_material_and_this_green_screen_onesie\" title=\"Do the most epic thing using green material and this green screen onesie\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Do the most epic thing using green material and this green screen onesie.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stick_the_heaviest_thing_to_the_board_using_three_of_the_ingredients_on_the_shelves\" title=\"Stick the heaviest thing to the board using three of the ingredients on the shelves\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Stick the heaviest thing to the board using three of the ingredients on the shelves. Once you've chosen your ingredients, you may not change your mind. You must choose your thing in the first two minutes.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guess_the_movie_that_your_teammate_is_saying\" title=\"Guess the movie that your teammate is saying\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Guess the movie that your teammate is saying. Your teammate can only say the first three letters of each word of the movie title.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Jumungo.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>Jumungo.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141525\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.122 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 928/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25804/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 182/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser functio